{"3873480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LUUP", "steam_appid": 3873480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a battle that repeats itself, where each action permanently shapes the time loop, you must deploy pieces to attack, defend, and manipulate an ever-growing sequence of past moves. Each round adds layers of complexity, turning every match into a tense, tactical battle across the past, presence and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Both you and your opponent perform your actions simultaneously, not knowing what the other is planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions play out in a looping timeline. Each round adds complexity, and while past moves stay fixed, future ones can still shift the outcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/05f056d66120ce7e9cc2f2312a8728c7.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/05f056d66120ce7e9cc2f2312a8728c7.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/05f056d66120ce7e9cc2f2312a8728c7.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze past turns, understand your opponent and deploy new pieces to influence or build on what's already happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/10b1cecc774908dbff48db058606216f.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/10b1cecc774908dbff48db058606216f.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/10b1cecc774908dbff48db058606216f.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To play a match in Luup, you’ll need to build a deck — a set of game pieces selected from your collection. Each piece offers different abilities and interactions, so how you combine them defines your strategy</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a battle that repeats itself, where each action permanently shapes the time loop, you must deploy pieces to attack, defend, and manipulate an ever-growing sequence of past moves. Each round adds layers of complexity, turning every match into a tense, tactical battle across the past, presence and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/37d5a1734dfccc1165011e16370e29db.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Both you and your opponent perform your actions simultaneously, not knowing what the other is planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.webm?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/99594a34db95eb75e9c1bdcda73a000e.mp4?t=1779768778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions play out in a looping timeline. Each round adds complexity, and while past moves stay fixed, future ones can still shift the outcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873480/extras/05f056d66120ce7e9cc2f2312a8728c7.poster.avif?t=1779768778\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s